00:36:42,761 --> 00:36:47,160
When you take out the variation in a river's flow, the fish and the bugs, they start to

467
00:36:47,161 --> 00:36:48,440
fade away.

468
00:36:48,441 --> 00:36:52,620
They're not getting the temperature cues and the volume cues that they need to complete

469
00:36:52,621 --> 00:36:56,780
their life cycles.

