00:36:56,781 --> 00:37:02,000
Held in a large dam's reservoir stratifies, altering the temperature and chemistry of

471
00:37:02,001 --> 00:37:04,840
the water in the river below.

472
00:37:04,841 --> 00:37:10,620
The water in a natural river is highly oxygenated and it's roiling around.

473
00:37:10,621 --> 00:37:17,380
When that river is dammed, you're basically changing this highly oxygen water into a slack

