00:37:43,221 --> 00:37:48,240
populations are a mere 6% of their historic levels

479
00:37:48,241 --> 00:37:53,840
But there may be a technological solution to this oxygen-depleted water.

480
00:37:53,841 --> 00:37:56,800
We've developed hollow turbine blades.

481
00:37:56,801 --> 00:38:01,540
Normal turbines are made of a big cast steel component and they're solid, but utilizing

