00:38:01,541 --> 00:38:06,740
these hollow turbine blade designs, we're able to draw air into the turbine in a cloud

483
00:38:06,741 --> 00:38:07,960
of small bubbles.

484
00:38:07,961 --> 00:38:13,200
They pass oxygen from the air bubbles into the water and therefore increase the dissolved

